# sarma_ml — ML Module (VoiceUp Decision Support)

This folder contains the Machine Learning (ML) pipeline used in the project to:
- generate a realistic training dataset (Road + Garbage complaints)
- train multi-task text classification models
- evaluate models (accuracy, confusion matrix, sample predictions)
- produce saved model artifacts used by the backend for real-time predictions

✅ The backend uses the saved artifacts to support **Decision Support** (ML + GIS + recurrence)

