STEP 1 — Generate Dataset
STEP 2 — Train Models (creates artifacts)
STEP 3 — Evaluate Models (creates reports)

reports_sarma 
The reports_sarma folder stores machine learning evaluation results such as confusion matrices 
and accuracy reports generated during development. 
It is not required during runtime and is only used to validate model performance.